&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Landor is looking for a Senior Experience Strategit to join our London studio. Could this be you? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are Landor, part of WPP&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;World-leading brand experts,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;underpinned by the most expansive strategic &amp;amp; creative capabilities in our category.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We make brands more valuable and less vulnerable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We build brands differently. We work with our clients to define and solve their business problems through the lens of brand. We strategically join the dots between our design, experience, governance and measurement capabilities, and always connect our brand work to business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Landor companies also include amp (sonic branding), bdg (workplace &amp;amp; architectural experts), Deep Local (creative technologists) and ManvsMachine (3D motion design).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;WPP.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As a Senior Experience Strategist, you’ll lead the strategic direction for our retail and spatial projects. You’ll combine deep insights into human behavior and brand goals to shape customer journeys, inspire creative teams, and guide clients toward impactful real-world experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Lead research into consumer behavior, spatial trends, and retail environments to uncover insights that drive design concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Map out end-to-end customer journeys that seamlessly connect physical, digital, and sensory brand touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Partner closely with 3D designers, creative leads, and architects to turn strategic ideas into buildable, engaging spaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Craft compelling stories and presentation decks that clearly explain the vision and win client buy-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Develop strategic briefs that inspire award-winning creative work and stand-out physical experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Write clear experience frameworks, spatial briefs, and point-of-view pieces for pitches and new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Act as a trusted partner to clients, helping them see new possibilities for their physical stores and brand spaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Mentor junior strategists and designers, offering day-to-day guidance to help them grow their skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Manage direct reports through regular check-ins, honest feedback, and career development chats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Keep projects on track strategically while keeping an eye on timelines, targets, and project scopes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Use AI tools in a smart, creative way to speed up research, find inspiration, and sharpen insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in experience strategy, retail planning, or spatial strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills in running qualitative research, competitor audits, and analysing physical site behaviours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear understanding of customer journeys and how people naturally move through and interact with physical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural storytelling skills with the ability to turn raw data and research into simple, inspiring strategic narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence leading client conversations, presenting big ideas, and influencing senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and experience working side-by-side with 3D designers, spatial teams, and external specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for retail design, hospitality, environmental branding, and emerging consumer behaviours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An eye for how digital technology, lighting, and materiality enhance physical brand spaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing or mentoring junior team members with a focus on supportive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with research tools, strategic mapping frameworks, presentation tools (Keynote/PowerPoint), and AI-driven insight software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We build brands. We build futures. Landor, a WPP company, is an equal opportunity employer. We consider all applicants without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics, committed to a culture of respect where everyone belongs and can progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-DNI #LI-DNP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Accounting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Toronto, Canada – Hybrid (2 days per week in office)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners, 60,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A fast-paced, global business with significant growth ambitions, and an Accounting function entering a period of transformation to support that growth. This is an exciting opportunity to drive that agenda, with full ownership of the numbers and the scope to shape what comes next for the function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the VP, Controllership and working in a leadership team alongside Reporting, Risk, and Payroll, the Director, Accounting holds full accountability for the completeness and accuracy of the Global General Ledger across the full P&amp;amp;L and Balance Sheet. This role will lead a team of accounting professionals and drive an improvement agenda that scales the function to meet the demands of a fast-paced business — through hands-on ownership of the numbers, critical thinking on every estimate and judgement, and continued development of the function beyond process compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Global General Ledger &amp;amp; Financial Close&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ultimate accountability for the Global GL under US GAAP, including the completeness, accuracy, and timely close of all entities worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a scalable end-to-end close operating model; set standards, drive consistency, and coach the team to execute with rigour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the quality of balance sheet reconciliations and close deliverables; identify and resolve issues in a timely manner, applying critical evaluation alongside sound accounting and commercial judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimates, accruals, and accounting positions that accurately reflect the pace and trajectory of the business, with the accounting telling the true story behind the numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver authoritative monthly and quarterly P&amp;amp;L and balance sheet flux analysis — clear on commercial and accounting drivers, risks and opportunities, and material one-off items&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply and Uphold Technical Accounting Standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The senior escalation point for accounting matters across the business; research, document, and defend positions on complex and novel issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical accounting support to business growth and commercial deals, including under ASC 606 (Revenue Recognition) and other judgement-intensive areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ground accounting in US GAAP principles and policies, with technical rigour as the baseline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate the accounting treatment of commercial arrangements with technical precision and commercial awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical thinking on every judgement call, with standard methodology as a starting point rather than a substitute for judgement&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the improvement agenda — simplify, standardise, and automate close processes, leading with the adoption of AI and enabling technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Finance, Enterprise Systems and AI Enablement on systems transformation that scales the function for the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and embed quality standards, governance frameworks, and documentation requirements across a geographically dispersed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance Operations and the Center of Excellence to maintain clear ownership and consistent execution across time zones (US West Coast, US East Coast, UK, India).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead &amp;amp; Develop the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop a team of accounting professionals, building technical capability and succession depth within the function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a high-performing team culture grounded in clear expectations, mutual accountability, meaningful development, and direct, honest communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Across the Organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with Finance and Commercial business partners; bring commercial perspective to accounting judgements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Represent the Accounting function with confidence and credibility at senior management level&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully-qualified accountant (ACA, ACCA, CPA, CA or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant post-qualification experience in financial accounting leadership, with full GL accountability and ownership of the end-to-end close cycle across a complex, multi-entity, global business — including the completeness and accuracy of the numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading and developing teams of qualified accountants and people managers&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical grounding in US GAAP, with the confidence to take and defend positions on complex matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numbers-first with strong ownership of accuracy — credible at senior stakeholder level, telling the story behind the numbers and comfortable pushing back when warranted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural change leader with an improvement mindset — builds the case, brings the team along, and delivers lasting change at pace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-performing people leader, invested in growth and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At ease in fast-paced, global complexity, fluent across both strategic and detailed work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to 20 days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on mental health and well-being:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid therapy sessions through SpringHealth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid subscription to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual company-wide week off a year - the whole team fully recharges (and returns without a pile-up of work!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid vacation + time off for your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid volunteer time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on your career growth:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development Dollars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to thousands of on-demand e-learnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20 days of paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health and dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive base salary and benefits including: health benefits; flexible spending account; retirement benefits; life insurance; paid time off (including PTO, paid sick leave, medical leave, bereavement leave, floating holidays and paid holidays); and parental leave benefits. This role is eligible to be considered for an annual bonus and equity grant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best connections happen face-to-face, whether you’re sitting down to dinner or having coffee with a coworker. That’s why OpenTable has adopted a hybrid workplace model. This role aligns with that approach, with an expectation of coming into the office two days a week—giving employees the best of both worlds: in-person collaboration and flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application or interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;#LI-LT1 #LI-Hybrid&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs, the company behind the open observability cloud, is founded on the principles of open source, open standards, open ecosystems, and open culture. Grafana Cloud, our fully managed observability platform, is flexible and built for scale. With Grafana Cloud&#39;s actually useful AI, organizations can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data to move at the speed of their ambitions. Today, more than 35 million users and 7,000+ customers – including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce – trust Grafana Labs to ensure reliability of their applications and systems, resolve incidents quickly, and optimize their telemetry to reduce noise and cost. We are a 100% remote company with 1,600+ team members across 40+ countries, and we’re backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote opportunity, and we would be interested in applicants located in Spain, Sweden, UK, Ireland or Germany.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Software Engineer - Synthetic Monitoring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Synthetic Monitoring squad builds and operates &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/products/cloud/synthetic-monitoring/&quot;&gt;Grafana Cloud Synthetic Monitoring&lt;/a&gt;, used by teams globally to proactively verify that their critical user journeys, APIs, and services work as expected - before their customers notice they don&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Synthetic Monitoring is a multi-tenant distributed system implemented in Go, running on Kubernetes across all major cloud providers (AWS, GCP, Azure), executing billions of synthetic tests each month from probe locations around the world and from customer-operated private probes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The product is in a scale phase, and our focus is on making Synthetic Monitoring a deeply integrated part of Grafana Cloud: connecting checks to real user experience and cross-product investigation workflows, making check results a trusted signal for AI-assisted workflows, and enabling large organizations to operate the product at enterprise scale on our infrastructure and on their own private probes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is full-stack in the real sense: the same engineer who designs how a check execution flows through scheduling, probes, and the telemetry pipeline should also be able to build the workflow that lets a user understand and act on the result.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a company we are remote-first and global, we embrace people of different experiences and backgrounds to build diverse teams where every person brings a new perspective to the software. We are looking for Software Engineers who are passionate about building reliable systems and providing seamless experiences for our customers to join our growing team! Our stack is Golang, Typescript and React, but we build tools for people using many other stacks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer on the Synthetic Monitoring squad, you will work across the whole system - Go services and agents on the backend, a TypeScript/React application on the frontend and you&#39;ll be expected to reason about it as one system, not two halves. Specifically, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own features end-to-end across the stack&lt;/strong&gt;: from API and data model design in Go, through the execution pipeline, to the user-facing workflows in TypeScript/React&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and evolve systems, not just features&lt;/strong&gt;: contribute to architectural decisions on scheduling, probe lifecycle, telemetry ingestion, and API design that shape how the product scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the cross-product and AI-assisted workflows&lt;/strong&gt; that connect Synthetic Monitoring to the wider Grafana Cloud platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make the product operable at enterprise scale&lt;/strong&gt;: the governance and organization primitives that let teams with hundreds of checks manage Synthetic Monitoring as code and with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Break down complex, ambiguous problems into incremental deliverables&lt;/strong&gt; and iterate quickly based on feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure quality through testing, observability of your own systems, and documentation&lt;/strong&gt;: our checks are something customers alert on, so reliability is a feature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a part of the team&#39;s on-call rotation&lt;/strong&gt; and take ownership of the services you&#39;re running&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest heavily in developer productivity. You can use modern AI coding assistants as part of your daily workflow (your choice of tools, within security guidelines), backed by a company-funded usage budget so you can iterate quickly without unnecessary friction. We encourage pragmatic AI-assisted development: faster prototyping, test generation, refactors, documentation, and incident follow-ups—always with strong code review and quality standards. You&#39;ll also have access to the latest frontier models from OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies you&#39;ll work with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go (backend services, APIs, and the synthetic monitoring agent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TypeScript / React (the Synthetic Monitoring app in Grafana)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes across AWS, GCP, and Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;k6 (the execution engine behind scripted and browser checks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grafana ecosystem (Mimir, Loki, Prometheus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;comfortable working in a remote-first company&lt;/strong&gt;; communication is key.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For us, working together means being &lt;strong&gt;collaborative, friendly, kind, and respectful&lt;/strong&gt;. We operate by consensus. You can contribute to a discussion, disagree constructively, and commit to the team&#39;s decision. You are able to communicate design decisions clearly in written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Go, or a path to it.&lt;/strong&gt; We build Synthetic Monitoring in Go. Deep experience building and operating production backend systems in another systems language (Rust, Java, C++) translates well; backend experience limited to JavaScript/Node.js runtimes does not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve run what you&#39;ve built: you&#39;ve owned production services, understand what it means to carry a pager, and treat reliability and toil reduction as part of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a &lt;strong&gt;systems thinker&lt;/strong&gt;: you reason about how components interact - data flow, failure modes, cost, and operational behavior - not just how a single feature works in isolation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatism and short feedback loops.&lt;/strong&gt; You break complex problems into increments: analyze, design, deliver an MVP, learn, iterate. You are able to design a solution, get feedback, and write a prototype by yourself - the ability to work on your own is crucial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a good understanding of &lt;strong&gt;a software development process that takes a user-centered approach&lt;/strong&gt;. You easily build an understanding of the users&#39; context and goals which will help you build the right solution with the maximum value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use &lt;strong&gt;AI tools as a natural part of your engineering workflow&lt;/strong&gt; - whether for accelerating exploration, code review, or reasoning through design tradeoffs - and you&#39;re thoughtful about where they help and where they don&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or operating multi-tenant SaaS systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability tools (Grafana, Datadog, New Relic, Sentry, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes in a production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with k6, Playwright, or browser automation at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to or maintaining open source projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;In the United Kingdom, the Base compensation range for this role is GBP 72&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;,000&lt;/span&gt; - GBP 90&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;,000&lt;/span&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed in the interview process. Benefits include equity, bonus (if applicable) and other benefits listed &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/about/careers/#jobs&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
