&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultural Stewardship: &lt;/strong&gt;You foster an inclusive, motivating, high-performance culture and establish modern department rituals that promote knowledge sharing and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven People Manager: &lt;/strong&gt;You have a track record of leading teams in a &quot;manager-of-managers&quot; structure or significant experience leading larger engineering departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change Agent:&lt;/strong&gt; You are passionate about the potential of AI in the software lifecycle and have a clear vision of how modern engineering organizations must evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend Background:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess a deep technical history in frontend development, allowing you to validate architectural decisions and act as a mentor on eye-level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand the economic drivers of an agency or consultancy and can translate KPIs into actionable success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication: &lt;/strong&gt;You are a confident communicator in both German and English, able to present complex technical topics to both stakeholders and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
