&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;break-all font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
